          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step_serel_count_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "Serel goes quiet for long enough to be uncomfortable. “I have counted it forty years,” he says. “Going north I get one number. Coming back I get another. I have done it in a day, both ways, sober, with a boy counting beside me.” He shrugs, and it is not a casual shrug. “The boy gets different numbers too, and not my different numbers.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "step_line_count"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "step_serel_count_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step_serel_count_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_horse_lords",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "step_serel_count_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step_serel_tally_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He brings out a roll of it, which is more than you expected and less tidy. “It does not settle,” he says. “Forty years of it not settling. I have never shown anybody because there is no way to say it that does not sound like a man who cannot count.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "grantItem": {
            "target": {
              "ref": "actor.id"
            },
            "item": "planting_tally",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "given:planting_tally",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "step_serel_tally_thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step_serel_tally_kept",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“It is forty years of looking foolish,” Serel says, “and it is mine,” and puts it away."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_horse_lords",
            "amount": -2
          }
        }
